{"text": "Yeatman Migration Services - FILE NOTE\nAgent: Fiona Yeatman, MARN 1844172        File: YMS-25-0448\nMatter: Partner visa (subclass 820/801), onshore        Note date: Thursday 6 November 2025\n\nAPPLICANT\nMaricel Dimaunahan (\"Cel\"), DOB 04/12/1993, born Batangas City. Philippine citizen. Passport P4418720B, exp 11 Jan 2030.\nCurrently on a Student visa (subclass 500) that ends 15 March 2026. Grant no. 0044187720931.\nSPONSOR\nBradley Cuthbertson (\"Brad\"), DOB 22 June 1987, Australian citizen by birth. Diesel fitter, FIFO out of Mackay.\nBoth at 7/42 Vulture Street, West End QLD 4101 since 1 Feb 2024 (joint lease).\nCel mob 0491 570 110, maricel.dim93@baysidemail.example. Brad mob 0491 570 159 (on site 2 weeks in 3, text first).\n\nRELATIONSHIP EVIDENCE - where we are\n- Met August 2022 at her cousin's wedding in Cairns. Living together since the West End lease. Married 20 September 2025 at the Brisbane registry, certificate no. B-2025-0441877.\n- Joint account: Moreton Bay Community Bank, BSB 124-081, acct 2204 4187, opened March 2024. Rent $640 a week goes from it.\n- Form 888 declarations: his mum and one workmate done; need two from her side.\n- Photos, travel to Batangas together Dec 2024, shared car rego 448 KT7 in both names.\n\nISSUES TO HANDLE (discussed with both, they agree to disclose)\n1. Cel's first marriage in the Philippines was annulled in 2021. Need the annotated PSA marriage certificate and the court decision. This is the one Home Affairs will look at hardest.\n2. Brad has a 2014 conviction for mid-range drink driving and a 2016 common assault (no conviction recorded). Sponsor police check will show both. Not a bar, but it goes in his statement.\n3. Health: Cel's medical is booked 19/11/2025, HAP ID 44187209. She is 14 weeks pregnant; chest x-ray can be deferred or done with shielding. Her Medicare (interim card) no. 6044 18772 1.\n4. Form 80 gaps: she worked cash-in-hand at a nail salon for 5 months in 2023. Advised on the 48 hrs/fortnight condition. My advice recorded; MARA Code of Conduct obligations explained.\n\nLODGEMENT\n- ImmiAccount created under her email. Username mdimaunahan93, password Kalabaw!2025 (she will change it after lodgement). TRN EGOX4418K7.\n- Draft application saved at https://online.immi.example/lusc/app/EGOX4418K7. Last session from her home IP, 203.0.113.9.\n- Visa application charge $9,365, to be paid on Brad's card. My fee $4,400 incl GST: $2,200 received 30/10, balance on lodgement.\n- Target lodgement by 28 Nov so the bridging visa is in place well before the student visa ends.   FY", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "407 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Fiona Yeatman", "Maricel Dimaunahan", "Bradley Cuthbertson", "Brad"], "companies": ["Yeatman Migration Services", "Moreton Bay Community Bank", "ImmiAccount", "immi.example"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Cairns", "Batangas City", "West End", "QLD", "Brisbane", "Moreton Bay", "home IP"], "health": ["pregnancy", "chest x-ray", "Medicare"], "sensitive": [], "names": ["Maricel", "Tor", "Cel", "Brad"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.20000000298023224, "modelMs": 17734.09999999404, "topicMs": 23790.70000000298, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 26, "text": "Yeatman Migration Services", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Yeatman Migration Services"}, {"start": 46, "end": 59, "text": "Fiona Yeatman", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Fiona Yeatman"}, {"start": 87, "end": 98, "text": "YMS-25-0448", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "YMS-25-0448"}, {"start": 130, "end": 137, "text": "820/801", "kind": "passport_dl", "source": "pa